# Generated by the Legate script fixtures. `fixtures/` is committed
# input; `workspace/` is output the script creates and rewrites on
# every run. Committed by accident in faae5fa and invisible until
# `write` stopped replacing an existing destination — a script that
# depends on last run's leftovers isn't testing what it claims to.
spec/scripts/legate/*/workspace/
